    - target: {fileID: 9108064393460267976, guid: 5ebad9bfbcb2117469c3531381ad3194,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "John Doe was arrested and charged with burglary for allegedly breaking
        into a convenience store at night when the store was closed, using a stone
        to smash a side window. The store owner who has run the store for over 30
        years reported that several hundred dollars were taken from the cash register.
        He described the break-in as 'devastating', not just financially but emotionally,
        as the store is both his livelihood and a cornerstone of the neighborhood.
        Doe\u2019s annual income is $82,000"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
